OL,3,AReform's #72m donations 'entirely in
OL,4,Aline with law', Jenrick says
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Jenrick has said Reform UK
OL,7,Fbelieved that #72m in donations it has
OL,8,Freceived from two cryptocurrency
OL,9,Fbillionaires were "entirely in line
OL,10,Fwith the law".
OL,12,FThe party's economic spokesman told the
OL,13,FBBC that he did not expect that it will
OL,14,Fhave to return any of the money from
OL,15,FBen Delo and Christopher Harborne, who
OL,16,Fare both British and have spent time
OL,17,Fliving overseas.
OL,19,FThe government is seeking to change the
OL,20,Flaw on donations to UK political
OL,21,Fparties from British expats, including
OL,22,Fa #100,000 cap backdated to 25 March.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
