OL,3,AAndy Burnham among tens of thousands
OL,4,Ataking part in Great North Run
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 63,000 have entered the run
OL,7,Fincluding the Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham
OL,10,FIt is the 45th time the half marathon
OL,11,Fhas been held
OL,13,FRunners start in Newcastle before
OL,14,Frunning over the Tyne Bridge and finish
OL,15,Fin South Shields
OL,17,FYou can watch live on BBC One from
OL,18,F10:00 and at the top of this page
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
