OL,3,ARussians seek answers over hundreds
OL,4,Amissing after Ukraine's 2024 incursion
OL,5,
OL,6,FLyubov says she tried to persuade her
OL,7,Fmother to leave her village in the
OL,8,FSudzha area, but blames Russian state
OL,9,FTV "propaganda" for her refusal to
OL,10,Flisten. Some 2,000 people remained in
OL,11,Fthe settlements captured by Ukraine's
OL,12,Fmilitary, Russian authorities estimate.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
